    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Julia is a handcrafted 2D <strong>puzzle-platformer inspired by Slavic folklore</strong> and set in a magical, decaying forest. You <strong>play as Julia, a blind girl</strong> who regains her sight after drinking from a mysterious spring deep in the woods. Once a sacred healing place, the spring is now forgotten, the forest around it overtaken by darkness and blight. Embark on an emotional journey through lush handcrafted levels, solve environmental puzzles, discover hidden paths, and meet mystical water spirits who grant you new abilities like double jump, dash, and underwater breathing. Help restore the forest\u2019s beauty and uncover the forgotten history of the shrine, the spring, and the land\u2019s people.<br><br>Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A heartfelt narrative inspired by real Slavic legends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whimsical, cozy art style with magical forest environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platforming and puzzle-solving with evolving mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain unique abilities from magical spirits (dash, double jump, more)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore hidden areas, floating villages, and sunken ruins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric music and sound design to enhance immersion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story about nature, memory, and healing</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Julia is a handcrafted 2D <strong>puzzle-platformer inspired by Slavic folklore</strong> and set in a magical, decaying forest. You <strong>play as Julia, a blind girl</strong> who regains her sight after drinking from a mysterious spring deep in the woods. Once a sacred healing place, the spring is now forgotten, the forest around it overtaken by darkness and blight. Embark on an emotional journey through lush handcrafted levels, solve environmental puzzles, discover hidden paths, and meet mystical water spirits who grant you new abilities like double jump, dash, and underwater breathing. Help restore the forest\u2019s beauty and uncover the forgotten history of the shrine, the spring, and the land\u2019s people.<br><br>Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A heartfelt narrative inspired by real Slavic legends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whimsical, cozy art style with magical forest environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platforming and puzzle-solving with evolving mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain unique abilities from magical spirits (dash, double jump, more)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore hidden areas, floating villages, and sunken ruins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric music and sound design to enhance immersion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story about nature, memory, and healing</p></li></ul>",
